[
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D423GP3914Y1HPHSXSXC3T",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "about_user",
    "text": "Kai has had a three-day headache, worse at the temples on both sides, after cutting back sharply on coffee last week.",
    "importance": 0.4675,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D3ZAW9JXGJZZDRMX9AP9PP",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D3ZNVFE340FBHK3C27T053",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T16:59:35.316Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D423GV3Y4C0KTGAYQB8YNJ",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Amara advised Kai to hydrate, take a steady small caffeine dose, taper by a quarter every few days, and use a simple painkiller if needed.",
    "importance": 0.565,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D3ZAW9JXGJZZDRMX9AP9PP",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D40DMXE42QKQM0HH02RWFZ",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T16:59:35.316Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D423GXSQ1Z8M756RHYZMX3",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara told Kai red flags needing same-day emergency care: thunderclap headache, fever with neck stiffness, one-sided weakness, confusion, vision changes, or headache waking him at night.",
    "importance": 0.65,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D3ZAW9JXGJZZDRMX9AP9PP",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D415FC71TJGA147X3PZ45M",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T16:59:35.316Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D5W4TDQ9JQDX1BNJZC95S6",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Amara argued for a nationwide four-day week: a protected-rest health and safety intervention, citing burnout cuts, better sleep, and stable patient care in pilots.",
    "importance": 0.6625,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D5SP56BD3A4WEHK9Q1YV7X",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D5SQTNG0ZVYT8YAC2A3WTR",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:31:17.195Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D5W4TF8WVSPDSNDY3DMV4M",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei's strongest opposing point: holding coverage constant took 18–27% more staffed hours, hitting small shift-based employers hardest.",
    "importance": 0.6475,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D5SP56BD3A4WEHK9Q1YV7X",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D5TRS2NNHBCNFXCTVJ48P1",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:31:17.195Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D5W4TG4Z405FVSX3BZVK5S",
    "characterId": "chr_seedAmara",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Debate verdict: the Against side made the stronger case, as neither side closed whether staffed hours rise or turnover savings repay costs.",
    "importance": 0.54,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D5SP56BD3A4WEHK9Q1YV7X",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D5V6ZN6R72VD3KSD6QJM62",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:31:17.195Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D4A5JHSD8VCH90N3MRTTYK",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "preference",
    "text": "Hana wants warm, cozy food for dinner — curry or the ramen place Takeshi swears by.",
    "importance": 0.4725,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D48T03CEQ4P3ZQ0JN71NRD",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D494YSX3XPXX85SF1GTFZK",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:03:59.567Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D4A5JSSWAN5ABPZJWRAXN3",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Hana stress-baked a lemon loaf today and wants a corner saved for dessert.",
    "importance": 0.59,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D48T03CEQ4P3ZQ0JN71NRD",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D494YSX3XPXX85SF1GTFZK",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:03:59.567Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D4CRR40KXYSK69HGRXV6FF",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Hana's grandma had a rule: one dish everybody loves, one nobody's tried, and arguing over the second is half the meal.",
    "importance": 0.62,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D48T03CEQ4P3ZQ0JN71NRD",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D4B2C14Z46HJ347961GZHX",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:05:24.735Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D4CRR58JVFJ203NW7NYWJ5",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "For ramen tonight Hana will order a safe dish plus something weird off the menu nobody has tried.",
    "importance": 0.5825,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D48T03CEQ4P3ZQ0JN71NRD",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D4B2C14Z46HJ347961GZHX",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:05:24.735Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D4CRR6SNTQ9HQX7F1PKMQJ",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Hana told Rin the lemon loaf isn't hers — Hana made it and decides who gets a corner.",
    "importance": 0.5525,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D48T03CEQ4P3ZQ0JN71NRD",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D4B2C14Z46HJ347961GZHX",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:05:24.735Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D4QEW8ADQTGH11A43KGH24",
    "characterId": "chr_seedHana",
    "worldId": "wld_seedSunnyHollow",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Hana left the lemon loaf in the oven eight extra minutes while repotting orchids, so its edges are rustic.",
    "importance": 0.355,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D4KQS2G77WSH7CKPT50DK9",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D4PHYP90JPK73QHBVJN9FN",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:11:15.080Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D5W4TVJGASYY2SXWGZGGSX",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei argued against a nationwide four-day week: pilots aren't a mandate, gains came from redesign not the calendar, and small shift-based firms bear the cost.",
    "importance": 0.6575,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D5SP56BD3A4WEHK9Q1YV7X",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D5SQSEE7V3AW5F2N0P6ZHQ",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:31:17.195Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D5W4VAZEDHANGH89DQCSFN",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei's strongest point: in nine shift-based organisations, holding coverage constant took 18–27% more staffed hours, landing on nights, weekends, and care homes.",
    "importance": 0.7325,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D5SP56BD3A4WEHK9Q1YV7X",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D5TFKC6FVR0P0WKSRQ78AV",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:31:17.195Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D5W4VDAVYM583AHSRE6KSK",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "fact",
    "text": "Mei conceded the leak is real—exhaustion billed as sickness absence, agency fees, resignations—but argued that's a case for fixing the leak, not a calendar mandate.",
    "importance": 0.665,
    "sourceSessionId": "ses_01M5D5SP56BD3A4WEHK9Q1YV7X",
    "sourceMessageId": "msg_01M5D5TKMZFX471ZEFDPK52AEF",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-20T17:31:17.195Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "mem_01M5D5W4VESY1TX87NE127ZADM",
    "characterId": "chr_seedMei",
    "worldId": "wld_seedMeridian",
    "kind": "event",
    "text": "Debate verdict: the Against side made the stronger case, as neither side closed whether staffed hours rise or turnover savings repay costs.",
    "importance": 0.5075,
